<title>USA: Ezcony Interamerica CFO Galea resigns.</title>
<headline>Ezcony Interamerica CFO Galea resigns.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ezcony Interamerica Inc said its chief financial officer, John Galea, has resigned from the company.</p>
<p>Ezcony said Galea told the company he wished to pursue new career opportunities.</p>
<p>The company said it will immediately begin its search for a successor. Until a new CFO is hired, the accounting and financial operations of the company will report to Ezcony president Ezra Cohen.</p>
</text>
